+# Task123 xtask Integration Implementation Plan
+
+> For agentic workers: use superpowers:subagent-driven-development or
+> superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use
+> checkbox syntax for tracking.
+
+Goal: Move the direct Task123 entrypoint policy into cargo xtask axvisor
+task123 without changing runner behavior.
+
+Architecture: Add a small AxVisor command module that builds an explicit
+runner plan and spawns the existing guest-comparison runner with inherited
+streams. Keep image pulling in the existing runner and axbuild image command.
+
+Tech Stack: Rust/clap in scripts/axbuild, Bash compatibility wrapper, existing
+Task123 shell contract tests.
+
+---
+
+### Task 1: Runner planning contract
+
+Files:
+
+- Create: scripts/axbuild/src/axvisor/task123.rs
+- Modify: scripts/axbuild/src/axvisor/mod.rs
+
+- Add a failing CLI test proving quick mode and an output path parse.
+- Add failing unit tests for explicit image selection, persistent image
+  selection, metadata defaulting, and runner arguments.
+- Implement the pure planner and execute it by spawning the existing
+  comparison runner with inherited stdio and environment.
+
+### Task 2: Compatibility entrypoint
+
+Files:
+
+- Modify: run-task123.sh
+- Modify: os/axvisor/scripts/test_run_task123_entrypoint.sh
+
+- Update the shell contract test first so it requires delegation to
+  cargo xtask axvisor task123.
+- Replace duplicate wrapper logic with the thin compatibility shim.
+
+### Task 3: Verification
+
+Files:
+
+- No production changes unless verification finds a defect.
+
+- Run focused axbuild tests for the new planner and CLI.
+- Run the direct entrypoint contract test.
+- Run existing Task123 lifecycle and realtime-control contract tests.
+- Run formatting and workspace package tests as appropriate.
